      "message": "Tom,\n\nI am seeing \"Error: RW image is not aligned to CONFIG_FLASH_WRITE_SIZE\" in my environment, and I can fix that by not reverting https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/3169964/6, and explitly sepcify the LMA region by:\n\n } \u003e FLASH AT\u003e EC_IMAGE_LMA_MEM_REGION \u003d 0xFF  \n \nCan you have a try if this fix in your environment? (I just updated my chroot, so that\u0027s probably the reason we see different results.)",
